The purpose of this code of ethics is to:
(1) Encourage high ethical standards in official conduct by county officials;
(2) Establish guidelines for ethical standards of conduct for all such officials by setting forth those acts or actions that are incompatible with the interest of the county;
(3) Require disclosure by such officials of private financial or other interests in matters affecting the county; and
(4) Serve as a basis for disciplining those who refuse to abide by its terms.
(Ord. No. 2017-02, § 2-41, 12-5-2017)

